        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had product liability insurance coverage for most of our manufacturing and marketing companies of up to US$4.57 billion, export credit insurance coverage for most of our manufacturing and marketing companies of up to US$3.21 billion and product transportation liability insurance coverage for all of our product transportation companies of up to RMB104.34 billion (US$14.92 billion).",
