        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we expand our solar wafer, cell and solar module production capacity and increase the output of these products, we mainly compete with both integrated and specialized manufacturers of solar power products, such as Longi Green Energy Technology Co., Ltd., Trina Solar Ltd., Canadian Solar Inc.",
