        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have devoted significant resources to developing solar module customers and a stable end-user customer base through establishing diversified sales channels comprising project developers, system integrators, distributors and sales agents and diversified marketing activities, including advertising on major industry publications, attending trade shows and exhibits worldwide as well as providing high quality services to our customers.",
